    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-coverage-question",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材提出的问题：测试检查了代码的多少部分",
        "moduleId": "why-coverage",
        "depth": "core",
        "markdown": "写完测试之后，教材先提出两个问题：现有的测试检查了代码的多少部分？更重要的是，哪些部分**还没有**被测试到？要回答这两个问题，可以用工具检查**代码覆盖率**（code coverage）。在 Python 生态中最常用的是 `coverage` 库，它统计测试运行时实际执行了哪些代码行。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-dacd3293b5aedfe0e5a195bd",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000071"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Testing Software",
                "Test Coverage"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6908,
              "lineEnd": 7044,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "c7b486aade302ecea175760b78036665062d080f68f85624bb0163b673ba5bc8"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-executed-vs-verified",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充读法：执行到不等于验证正确",
        "moduleId": "why-coverage",
        "depth": "support",
        "markdown": "覆盖率是一个**执行比例**：分子是测试运行时被执行到的语句行，分母是统计范围内的可执行语句。它擅长回答“哪些代码从未被运行”，却不回答“运行到的代码结果是否正确”——断言写错时，被执行的代码照样计入覆盖率。因此覆盖率首先是发现测试盲区的筛子，而不是正确性证明。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-coverage-question"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-install-and-run",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "教材步骤：安装 coverage 并用它启动 pytest",
        "moduleId": "measure-workflow",
        "depth": "core",
        "markdown": "教材给出的操作顺序分两步：先安装 `coverage` 库，再让 `coverage` 代替我们启动 pytest。\n\n```bash\n$ pip install coverage\n$ coverage run -m pytest\n```\n\n示例输出与直接运行 pytest 时相同：收集到 4 个用例，全部通过，耗时约 0.7 秒。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-dacd3293b5aedfe0e5a195bd",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000071"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Testing Software",
                "Test Coverage"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6908,
              "lineEnd": 7044,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "c7b486aade302ecea175760b78036665062d080f68f85624bb0163b673ba5bc8"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-why-run-as-module",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "补充解释：为什么要用 coverage run -m pytest",
        "moduleId": "measure-workflow",
        "depth": "support",
        "markdown": "`-m` 让 coverage 把 pytest 当作模块运行：由 coverage 启动解释器，并在执行过程中记录走过了哪些代码行。直接敲 `pytest` 不会产生这份记录，所以要统计覆盖率就必须用 coverage 作为入口。这个命令不改变测试内容，只改变执行入口。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-install-and-run"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-coverage-data-file",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "教材说明：数据写入 .coverage 文件",
        "moduleId": "measure-workflow",
        "depth": "support",
        "markdown": "`coverage` 命令本身不在终端显示统计信息，因为把统计混进程序输出会造成混淆。它把覆盖率数据写进当前目录下一个以点开头的文件 `.coverage`。要显示这些数据，再运行：\n\n```bash\n$ coverage report -m\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
