            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-report-example",
        "kind": "table",
        "title": "教材示例：coverage report -m 的输出",
        "moduleId": "read-and-diagnose",
        "depth": "core",
        "markdown": "教材用一次真实运行展示了报告的样子：`bin/countwords.py` 只有 65% 的行被执行，`bin/plotcounts.py` 只有 36%，而测试文件本身是 100%，全部文件合计 58%。\n\n| 文件 | 语句数 | 未执行 | 覆盖率 | 未执行行 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `bin/countwords.py` | 20 | 7 | 65% | 25–26, 30–38 |\n| `bin/plotcounts.py` | 58 | 37 | 36% | 48–55, 75–77, 82–83, 88–118, 122–140 |\n| `bin/test_zipfs.py` | 31 | 0 | 100% | — |\n| `bin/utilities.py` | 8 | 5 | 38% | 18–22 |\n| TOTAL | 117 | 49 | 58% |  |",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-dacd3293b5aedfe0e5a195bd",
